<bblocks://ogc.bbr.wf4ever.wf4ever-profiles.complete-provenance-trace> a skos:Concept,
        dcat:Dataset,
        bblocks:Schema ;
    rdfs:label "Complete Workflow Provenance Trace" ;
    dct:abstract "Master profile combining Research Object, Workflow Description, and Workflow Execution Provenance"^^<https://www.w3.org/ns/iana/media-types/text/markdown> ;
    dct:created "2025-01-11T00:00:00+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dct:description [ dct:format "application/json" ;
            rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-wf4ever/build/generateddocs/json-full/bbr/wf4ever/wf4ever-profiles/complete-provenance-trace/index.json> ],
        [ dct:format "text/html" ;
            rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-wf4ever/bblock/ogc.bbr.wf4ever.wf4ever-profiles.complete-provenance-trace> ],
        [ dct:format "text/markdown" ;
            rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-wf4ever/build/generateddocs/markdown/bbr/wf4ever/wf4ever-profiles/complete-provenance-trace/index.md> ],
        """## Description

This master profile combines all elements of the Wf4Ever ontology suite to represent a complete workflow provenance trace:

- **Research Object (RO)**: Container aggregating all workflow-related resources
- **Workflow Description (WFDESC)**: Prospective provenance - the workflow structure and specification
- **Workflow Execution (WFPROV)**: Retrospective provenance - the actual execution trace

This building block demonstrates the full integration of:
1. Workflow structure (inputs, outputs, steps)
2. Execution trace (runs, artifacts, agents)
3. Research object packaging (aggregation, annotations, manifest)

## Purpose

This profile serves multiple purposes:
- **Validation**: End-to-end test of the complete Wf4Ever model
- **Documentation**: Demonstrates how all pieces fit together
- **Interoperability**: Shows mapping to PROV-O and other standards
- **Real-world example**: Based on actual CWLProv data from scientific workflows

## Use Cases

1. **Scientific Workflow Archival**: Package complete workflow execution for reproducibility
2. **Provenance Tracking**: Track data lineage from input to output through workflow steps
3. **Workflow Sharing**: Share not just the workflow definition, but execution traces and results
4. **Compliance**: Meet FAIR data principles with complete provenance metadata

## Structure

A complete provenance trace contains:

```
Research Object
├── Manifest (describes RO)
├── Workflow (wfdesc:Workflow)
│   ├── Inputs (wfdesc:Input)
│   ├── Outputs (wfdesc:Output)
│   └── Processes (wfdesc:Process)
├── WorkflowRun (wfprov:WorkflowRun)
│   ├── Used (input artifacts)
│   ├── Generated (output artifacts)
│   ├── wasAssociatedWith (agents/engines)
│   └── ProcessRuns (sub-executions)
└── Annotations (metadata, attributions)
```

## Mapping to Standards

- **PROV-O**: WorkflowRun → prov:Activity, Artifacts → prov:Entity
- **DCAT**: Research Object → dcat:Dataset
- **OGC API Processes**: Workflow → Process description
- **ORE**: Research Object uses ORE aggregation model
"""^^<https://www.w3.org/ns/iana/media-types/text/markdown> ;
    dct:hasVersion "0.1" ;
    dct:modified "2025-12-10"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:source <http://purl.org/wf4ever/model>,
        <https://w3id.org/cwl/prov> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-wf4ever/> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Complete Workflow Provenance Trace" ;
    skos:topConceptOf <https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-wf4ever/> ;
    dcat:keyword "cwl",
        "end-to-end",
        "profile",
        "provenance",
        "research-object",
        "workflow" ;
    prof:hasResource [ dct:conformsTo <https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema> ;
            dct:format "application/json" ;
            prof:hasArtifact <https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-wf4ever/build/annotated/bbr/wf4ever/wf4ever-profiles/complete-provenance-trace/schema.json> ;
            prof:hasRole role:schema ],
        [ dct:conformsTo <https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema> ;
            dct:format "application/yaml" ;
            prof:hasArtifact <https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-wf4ever/build/annotated/bbr/wf4ever/wf4ever-profiles/complete-provenance-trace/schema.yaml> ;
            prof:hasRole role:schema ],
        [ dct:conformsTo <https://www.w3.org/TR/json-ld11/> ;
            dct:format "application/ld+json" ;
            prof:hasArtifact <https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-wf4ever/build/annotated/bbr/wf4ever/wf4ever-profiles/complete-provenance-trace/context.jsonld> ;
            prof:hasRole role:mapping ] ;
    bblocks:dependsOn <bblocks://ogc.bbr.wf4ever.ro.Manifest>,
        <bblocks://ogc.bbr.wf4ever.ro.ResearchObject>,
        <bblocks://ogc.bbr.wf4ever.wfdesc.Workflow>,
        <bblocks://ogc.bbr.wf4ever.wfprov.WorkflowRun> ;
    bblocks:hasSourceJsonLdContext <https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-wf4ever/_sources/wf4ever-profiles/complete-provenance-trace/context.jsonld> ;
    bblocks:scope <http://www.opengis.net/def/bblocks/scope/unstable> ;
    bblocks:status <http://www.opengis.net/def/status/under-development> ;
    bblocks:validationPassed false .

<bblocks://ogc.bbr.wf4ever.wf4ever.Dataset> a skos:Concept,
        dcat:Dataset,
        bblocks:Schema ;
    rdfs:label "wf4ever:Dataset" ;
    dct:abstract "A dataset artifact - a collection of data values or files representing a scientific dataset."^^<https://www.w3.org/ns/iana/media-types/text/markdown> ;
    dct:created "2025-11-07T00:00:00+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dct:description [ dct:format "text/html" ;
            rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-wf4ever/bblock/ogc.bbr.wf4ever.wf4ever.Dataset> ],
